}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Problem",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Optimization problem, formulated by its data, its decision variables, at least one objective and, optionally, constraints. A solution is an assignment of values to its decision variables."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Problema de optimización, formulado mediante sus datos, sus variables de decisión, al menos un objetivo y, opcionalmente, restricciones. Una solución es una asignación de valores a sus variables de decisión."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Problem"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Problema"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid189"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Magnitud del problema cuyo valor se conoce antes de resolverlo y que caracteriza una instancia concreta del problema."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Problem quantity whose value is known before solving the problem and that characterizes a specific instance of it."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Datos del problema"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Problem Data"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Constituent of the mathematical formulation of an optimization problem: its data, its decision variables, its objectives or its constraints."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Constituyente de la formulación matemática de un problema de optimización: sus datos, sus variables de decisión, sus objetivos o sus restricciones."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Elemento del problema"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Problem Element"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemInstance",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Instancia concreta de un problema, dada por los datos ligados a sus datos del problema."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Specific instance of a problem, given by the data bound to its problem data."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Instancia del problema"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Problem Instance"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemQuantity",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Magnitud, o colección indexada de magnitudes, que interviene en la formulación del problema y se representa mediante un símbolo en sus expresiones. Su valor se conoce de antemano (datos) o se busca al resolver el problema (variable de decisión). No se refiere a una magnitud física."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Quantity, or indexed collection of quantities, that takes part in the formulation of the problem and is represented by a symbol in its expressions. Its value is either known in advance (data) or sought when solving the problem (decision variable). It does not refer to a physical quantity."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Magnitud del problema"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Problem Quantity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemElement"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RCLRandomness",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Anchura de la lista restringida de candidatos, de voraz (0) a aleatoria (1)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Width of the restricted candidate list, from greedy (0) to random (1)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Aleatoriedad de la RCL"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "RCL Randomness"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasDefaultValue" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal",
    "@value" : "0.3"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasValueDomain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#UnitInterval"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomDecisionCrossoverComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de cruce que decide aleatoriamente, para cada posición, de qué progenitor hereda el valor el descendiente."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Crossover component that decides randomly, for each position, from which parent the offspring inherits the value."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de cruce por decisión aleatoria"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Random Decision Crossover Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#CrossoverComponent"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomGenerationComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de generación que obtiene cada solución de forma uniformemente aleatoria a partir de la representación de las variables de decisión."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Generation component that draws each solution uniformly at random from the representation of the decision variables."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de generación aleatoria"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Random Generation Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#GenerationComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid190"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomResetMutationComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de variación que sustituye el valor de una posición aleatoria por un valor aleatorio de su dominio."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Variation component that replaces the value of a random position with a random value of its domain."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de mutación por reinicio aleatorio"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Random Reset Mutation Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RandomSelectionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección que selecciona aleatoriamente una pareja de individuos. Tiene un parámetro de elitismo."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Selection component that selects a pair of individuals at random. It has an elitism parameter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección aleatoria"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Random Selection Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SelectionComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid191"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid193"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Reals",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#BaseType"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Conjunto de los números reales."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Set of real numbers."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Reales"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Reals"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RepairComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de modificación que convierte soluciones no factibles en factibles."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Modification component that turns infeasible solutions into feasible ones."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de reparación"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Repair Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ModificationComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid194"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RepairHandling",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ConstraintHandling"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Las soluciones producidas por componentes inseguros se reparan."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Solutions produced by unsafe components are repaired."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Repair"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Reparación"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#RouletteWheelSelectionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección que selecciona cada individuo con probabilidad proporcional a su posición según la aptitud. Tiene un parámetro de elitismo."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Selection component that selects each individual with probability proportional to its fitness rank. It has an elitism parameter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección por ruleta"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Roulette Wheel Selection Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SelectionComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid195"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid197"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Run",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "One run of an execution, with the solutions it returned."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Una repetición de una ejecución, con las soluciones que devolvió."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Repetición"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Run"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Safe",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ComponentSafety"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "El componente solo produce soluciones factibles."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The component only produces feasible solutions."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Safe"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Seguro"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Scalar",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ScalarShape"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "La forma de los valores individuales."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The shape of single values."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Escalar"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Scalar"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ScalarShape",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Forma de una magnitud formada por un único valor. Su única instancia es Scalar."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Shape of a quantity made up of a single value. Its only instance is Scalar."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Forma escalar"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Scalar Shape"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#DataShape"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid198"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ScalarVariable",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Decision variable that takes a single value (e.g. the number of vehicles to use). It is inferred from the shape, so it does not need to be asserted."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Variable de decisión que toma un único valor (p. ej., el número de vehículos que se van a utilizar). Se deduce de la forma, por lo que no es necesario declararla."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Scalar Variable"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Variable escalar"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#DecisionVariable"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid200"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SelectionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de modificación que selecciona los individuos que formarán parte de la siguiente generación."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Modification component that selects the individuals that will take part in the next generation."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Selection Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ModificationComponent"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SequenceShape",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Colección cuyos valores están ordenados, de modo que cada uno ocupa una posición (p. ej., si cada objeto se mete en la mochila)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Collection whose values are ordered, so that each one occupies a position (e.g. whether each item is put in the knapsack)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Forma de secuencia"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Sequence Shape"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Sequence"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid204"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SequenceVariable",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Decision variable made up of an ordered sequence of values, one per position, which may be repeated unless it is a permutation (e.g. whether each item is put in the knapsack). It is inferred from the shape, so it does not need to be asserted."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Variable de decisión formada por una secuencia ordenada de valores, uno por posición, que pueden repetirse salvo que sea una permutación (p. ej., si cada objeto se mete en la mochila). Se deduce de la forma, por lo que no es necesario declararla."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Sequence Variable"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Variable de secuencia"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#DecisionVariable"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid208"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SequentialIterativeSelectionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección iterativa que selecciona los individuos de la población uno a uno, en orden (p. ej. cada hormiga o cada partícula)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Iterative selection component that selects the individuals of the population one by one, in order (e.g. each ant or each particle)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección iterativa secuencial"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Sequential Iterative Selection Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#IterativeSelectionComponent"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SetShape",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Colección cuyos valores no están ordenados ni se repiten (p. ej., una selección de k ubicaciones de entre N)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Collection whose values are neither ordered nor repeated (e.g. a selection of k locations out of N)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Forma de conjunto"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Set Shape"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Set"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid212"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SetVariable",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Decision variable made up of an unordered selection of values without repetitions (e.g. the k locations where facilities are opened). It is inferred from the shape, so it does not need to be asserted."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Variable de decisión formada por una selección no ordenada de valores sin repeticiones (p. ej., las k ubicaciones en las que se abren instalaciones). Se deduce de la forma, por lo que no es necesario declararla."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Set Variable"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Variable de conjunto"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#DecisionVariable"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid218"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ShakingComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de variación que aplica k movimientos aleatorios del vecindario que usa, donde k es el valor de la estructura de datos que lee (el vecindario actual de una búsqueda de vecindario variable)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Variation component that applies k random moves of the neighbourhood it uses, where k is the value of the data structure it reads (the current neighbourhood of a variable neighbourhood search)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de agitación"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Shaking Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SimplePairSelectionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección que selecciona individuos por parejas en orden. Tiene un parámetro de elitismo."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Selection component that selects pairs of individuals in order. It has an elitism parameter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de selección simple por parejas"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Simple Pair Selection Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SelectionComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid222"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid224"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SingleSolutionConstructionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de construcción que construye una única solución (tamaño de población igual a 1)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Construction component that builds a single solution (population size equal to 1)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de construcción de solución única"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Single Solution Construction Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ConstructionComponent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid225"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SingleSolutionGenerationComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de generación que genera una única solución inicial (tamaño de población igual a 1)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Generation component that generates a single initial solution (population size equal to 1)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de generación de solución única"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Single Solution Generation Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#GenerationComponent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid234"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SingleSolutionMetaheuristic",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Metaheuristic that works with a single solution at a time."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Metaheurística que trabaja con una única solución a la vez."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Metaheurística basada en solución única"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Single Solution Based Metaheuristic"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid243"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SolutionFirstDimensionSize",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SolutionSizeReference"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Size of the first dimension of the solution handled by the algorithm: the length of a sequence or the number of rows of a matrix."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tamaño de la primera dimensión de la solución que maneja el algoritmo: la longitud de una secuencia o el número de filas de una matriz."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Solution First Dimension Size"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tamaño de la primera dimensión de la solución"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasDimensionIndex" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger",
    "@value" : "1"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SolutionRecord",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A solution returned by a run, with the values of its variables and of its objectives."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Una solución devuelta por una repetición, con los valores de sus variables y de sus objetivos."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Registro de solución"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Solution Record"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SolutionSecondDimensionSize",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SolutionSizeReference"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Size of the second dimension of the solution handled by the algorithm: the number of columns of a matrix."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tamaño de la segunda dimensión de la solución que maneja el algoritmo: el número de columnas de una matriz."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Solution Second Dimension Size"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tamaño de la segunda dimensión de la solución"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasDimensionIndex" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger",
    "@value" : "2"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SolutionSizeReference",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Especificación de valor dada por el tamaño de una dimensión de la solución que maneja el algoritmo. Permite dimensionar las estructuras de datos del algoritmo sin depender de un problema concreto (p. ej., una matriz de feromonas de n × n)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Value specification given by the size of one dimension of the solution handled by the algorithm. It allows algorithm data structures to be sized independently of any specific problem (e.g. an n × n pheromone matrix)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Referencia al tamaño de la solución"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Solution Size Reference"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueSpecification"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid250"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Solutions",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#BaseType"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Conjunto de soluciones candidatas del problema que se resuelve. Es el tipo base de las estructuras de datos que almacenan soluciones (p. ej., archivos o listas tabú)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Set of candidate solutions of the problem being solved. It is the base type of data structures that store solutions (e.g. archives or tabu lists)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Soluciones"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Solutions"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#StoppingCriterionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de bucle que crea el bucle principal del algoritmo y determina cuándo detenerlo. Se detiene en cuanto alcanza cualquiera de sus límites: iteraciones, tiempo, evaluaciones, iteraciones sin mejora o valor objetivo."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Loop component that creates the main loop of the algorithm and determines when to stop it. It stops as soon as it reaches any of its limits: iterations, time, evaluations, iterations without improvement or target value."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de criterio de parada"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Stopping Criterion Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#LoopComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid251"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#StorageSize",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#Parameter"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Maximum number of solutions that a data handler keeps (e.g. a tabu list or an archive)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Número máximo de soluciones que guarda un manejador de datos (p. ej. una lista tabú o un archivo)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Storage Size"
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Tamaño del almacenamiento"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasDefaultValue" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
    "@value" : "10"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasValueDomain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#NonNegativeIntegers"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#StrengthFitnessComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de asignación de aptitud que da a cada individuo la suma de las fuerzas (número de individuos dominados) de los que lo dominan (aptitud bruta de SPEA2)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Fitness assignment component that gives each individual the sum of the strengths (number of dominated individuals) of those that dominate it (SPEA2 raw fitness)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de aptitud por fuerza"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Strength Fitness Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#FitnessAssignmentComponent"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SubtractionComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Operador de población que elimina de su entrada las soluciones almacenadas en las estructuras de datos que lee (p. ej. una lista tabú)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Population operator that removes from its input the solutions stored in the data structures it reads (e.g. a tabu list)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de sustracción"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Subtraction Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#PopulationOperatorComponent"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SwapMutationComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de variación que intercambia los valores de dos posiciones aleatorias de una permutación."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Variation component that exchanges the values of two random positions of a permutation."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de mutación por intercambio"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Swap Mutation Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid259"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#SwapNeighbourhoodComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Neighbourhood of the permutations obtained by exchanging the values of two positions."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Vecindario de las permutaciones obtenidas intercambiando los valores de dos posiciones."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de vecindario de intercambio"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Swap Neighbourhood Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#NeighbourhoodComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid260"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#TableData",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Datos del problema organizados como una tabla de registros, cada uno de los cuales describe una entidad del problema mediante sus atributos (p. ej., las coordenadas de cada ciudad). Se deduce de la forma, por lo que no es necesario declararla."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Problem data organized as a table of records, each of which describes an entity of the problem by means of its attributes (e.g. the coordinates of each city). It is inferred from the shape, so it does not need to be asserted."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Datos en tabla"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Table Data"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid261"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#TableShape",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Forma de una magnitud formada por registros homogéneos (filas), cada uno de los cuales describe una entidad del problema mediante atributos con nombre (columnas) (p. ej., las coordenadas de cada ciudad)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Shape of a quantity made up of homogeneous records (rows), each of which describes an entity of the problem by means of named attributes (columns) (e.g. the coordinates of each city)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Forma de tabla"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Table Shape"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Table"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#DataShape"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid265"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid266"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#TabuListUpdateComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Data handler that stores the solutions it receives in the list it writes, discarding the oldest beyond the storage size, and passes them on."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Manejador de datos que almacena las soluciones que recibe en la lista que escribe, descartando las más antiguas por encima del tamaño de almacenamiento, y las deja pasar."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Componente de actualización de la lista tabú"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Tabu List Update Component"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#DataHandlerComponent"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid267"
  } ]
